I walk across the large square.
Suddenly, I hear music.
On the corner stands a street musician.
He plays the guitar.
I listen to the good music.
I look at him for a long time.
Then I walk on.
I forget the museum.
I also forget my route.
Instead I walk down a narrow side street.
It is very quiet here.
All around I only see some small houses.
Then I stop.
Where is the museum?
Now I look around.
I cannot see it anymore.
I quickly look back up the street.
I cannot see the square either.
I am completely lost.
